Measure a headless terminal through its snapshot channel and report every result.

The upstream driver and test methods still run on the terminal pty. Only
screen inspection uses the optional channel; direct protocol queries keep
their original path. DA1 checks the declared VT220/color profile rather than
xterm build options. A final count detects interrupted or empty runs.

